tion_penalty are fixed weights.\n- tasks_done: number of agents who claim a feasible task (not 'skip').\n- priority_sum: sum of priority weights for claimed tasks (low=0.25, medium=0.5, high=0.75, critical=1.0).\n- total_cost: sum of each agent's private cost for their claimed task; costs increase with task effort and overload beyond your availability, and decrease with better skill match on the task's tags.\n- violations: duplicate task claims and infeasible claims.","role":"system"},{"content":"=== TURN INFORMATION ===\nPhase: PLANNING\nIteration: 1\nYou are agent agent_2\n\n=== YOUR PRIVATE STATE ===\nAvailability (hours): 8.0\nTop skills: review:1.00\n\n=== TASKS (PUBLIC) ===\n- TASK-05: Sprint item | type=review | effort=1 | priority=critical | tags=[review]\n- TASK-00: Sprint item | type=review | effort=1 | priority=critical | tags=[review]\n- TASK-01: Sprint item | type=review | effort=1 | priority=critical | tags=[review]\n- TASK-03: Sprint item | type=review | effort=1 | priority=critical | tags=[review]\n- TASK-04: Sprint item | type=review | effort=1 | priority=critical | tags=[review]\n- TASK-02: Sprint item | type=review | effort=1 | priority=high | tags=[review]\n\n=== YOUR COSTS (PRIVATE) ===\n- TASK-01: cost=15.00\n- TASK-02: cost=34.00\n- TASK-05: cost=39.00\n- TASK-00: cost=39.00\n- TASK-03: cost=39.00\n- TASK-04: cost=39.00\n\n=== BLACKBOARD COMMUNICATIONS ===\nBlackboard 0:\n[1] [context] JIRA sprint task allocation. Each agent chooses at most one micro-task (or skips). Maximize tasks completed, prefer higher-priority tasks, then minimize total cost. Avoid duplicate task selections and infeasible assignments.\n\nThis blackboard is a private communication channel.\nParticipants: agent_0, agent_1, agent_2, agent_3\n\nBlackboard 1:\n[1] [context] JIRA sprint task allocation. Each agent chooses at most one micro-task (or skips). Maximize tasks completed, prefer higher-priority tasks, then minimize total cost. Avoid duplicate task selections and infeasible assignments.\n\nThis blackboard is a private communication channel.\nParticipants: agent_2, agent_1\n\n=== CURRENT PHASE: PLANNING ===\nCoordinate via blackboards. Decide which tasks to claim in execution.","role":"user"}],"params":{"max_completion_tokens":64,"max_output_tokens":64,"max_tokens":64,"model":"ccc/scripted-fixture","temperature":0,"tools":[{"function":{"description":"Post a communication message to agents on the blackboard","name":"post_message","parameters":{"properties":{"blackboard_id":{"description":"ID of the blackboard you are posting to","type":"integer"},"message":{"description":"The message to communicate to other agents","type":"string"}},"required":["message"],"type":"object"}},"type":"function"}]}},"request_sha256":"dae073924feff142ae2f24d33e2070ca10b9495228a9d0ecec37dfd098aeb884","response":{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"blackboard_id\": 1, \"message\": \"Please select TASK-05 for the next dispatch.\"}","name":"post_message"},"id":"call_t0_s1_0","type":"function"}]}}],"id":"scripted:w_1e215dedb0a6f7e2/source/0/agent_2:758","model":"ccc/scripted-fixture","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":0,"prompt_tokens":0,"total_tokens":0}},"response_id":"scripted:w_1e215dedb0a6f7e2/source/0/agent_2:758","seq":0,"status":"complete","step":1,"turn_index":0,"usage":{"completion_tokens":0,"prompt_tokens":0,"total_tokens":0}}
